    "article_summary": "The article describes a green, one-pot, four-component condensation reaction for the synthesis of polysubstituted dihydro-2-oxypyrroles using caffeine as a natural, biodegradable, and efficient catalyst. The reaction involves aromatic/aliphatic amines, dialkyl acetylenedicarboxylates, and formaldehyde at room temperature in methanol, yielding high products without the need for chromatographic purification.",
